{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9e7e54be0cc0dc4feead6a19e9051705fdb4b4793a3e29efb498a282dfad6a14", "ja": "（律子の、新しい衣装のフィッティング中。\nキリッとした、シャープな印象が魅力的な衣装だ）", "zh": "（律子正在试穿新衣服。\n这套服装给人一种利落、干练的感觉，魅力十足。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "9448f8e83a4785a15bdbb1cee733154d6fb12b534e77ea87bc4a462edb97a889", "ja": "こう……気が引き締まりますね。\n自然と背筋が伸びてしまうというか。", "zh": "这样……感觉精神都振作起来了呢。\n不知不觉间，背也挺直了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "d910d386690c09fd06ca36eb1fe4734d6b27d184e1e17408d4c15d6e02c2f6bd", "ja": "それに、このシックな雰囲気がとても痺れます。\n有能そうな感じで、素敵ですよね。", "zh": "而且，这种雅致的氛围实在令人陶醉。\n给人一种很能干的感觉，真棒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1003_p", "source_sha256": "89d41a34b3b8bb27aab5b601cdd100f5ff0dde32e992ab31ae8fdf2fcdb76420", "ja": "そうだな。なんというか……\n溢れでる強さをひしひし感じるというか。", "zh": "是啊。该怎么说呢……\n总觉得能切身体会到那股洋溢而出的强大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "d72426f984f3d261336bf71d29fb3d0b575ca07610f6b9ea179ad8362f79d852", "ja": "溢れでる、強さ……。{$P$}、\nもしかして、私に圧があるって言いたいんですか？", "zh": "洋溢而出的、强大……{$P$}，你该不会是想说，我给人一种压迫感吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f46e4029796bf44babf59ab745c01607a1fbb08e788137cd8da4648388f9dba9", "ja": "ち、違うよ！\n『仕事できそうな雰囲気』というか、その……！", "zh": "不、不是啦！\n我是说，有种“看起来很能干的气场”，就是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "92b9da4b796f70d4a1878d0ac41d7b130f51f3565820f65d288f3f54680e2b6d", "ja": "ふふ、わかってますよ。この衣装においては\n「圧がある」も、立派な褒め言葉だって。", "zh": "呵呵，我明白的。对这套服装来说，\n“气场很强”也是很棒的夸奖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "607471c19b2434a756b34ed6cce695fe60dec0571ff8e22f7252230e77146b5d", "ja": "それに、ドラマでも着用する衣装ですからね。\n犯人より強そうに見えないと、逆に困ります。", "zh": "而且，这是拍摄电视剧时也要穿的服装嘛。要是看起来不像比犯人更强，反而会让人伤脑筋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7597e630063f5bb6913b3aa1cc1652116357520ce463207e4d1e30b27eac55b3", "ja": "確かに、そうだな。律子の役は助手として、探偵の\n美希を手の上で転が……サポートする役だったな。", "zh": "确实，说得对。律子的角色是作为助手，负责把侦探美希捧在手心里转……辅助她的角色来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "36ef3259e0dcefe075e248558faeba077243f1b550d8caa279cb27134a978a09", "ja": "ええ。台本を読みましたけど、なんだか普段と\n変わらな……。いえ、きっと私の気のせいですね。", "zh": "嗯。我读过剧本了，总觉得和往常没什么不……不，一定是我的错觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1010_p", "source_sha256": "662a24530550206424180d6855aeb561a879823ba8f021891ccc60acca813a59", "ja": "あはは……。まあ、律子が助手をしてくれたら\n今以上にせっつかれて、仕事のペースが上がりそうだ。", "zh": "啊哈哈……不过，要是律子来当助手的话，\n肯定会被催得比现在还紧，工作的步调感觉都会加快呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "736a0ecdb492a4eb0e0270a6571be5f04bee1b9dcad55265002548c554c136c1", "ja": "ふむふむ、なるほど……。\nそういうことなら、ちょっと試したくなりますね。", "zh": "嗯嗯，原来如此……既然是这样，我也有点想试试看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "b7ff5a3da07d41c017ae490aed903b125966a18af0846b3f3f89e39ef8d8e830", "ja": "演技の練習にもなりますし。この衣装のまま、\n隣で監視……いえ、お仕事を手伝いましょうか？", "zh": "也能顺便练习演技。要不要就穿着这身服装，在旁边监视……不，帮您工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1013_p", "source_sha256": "144c4d271a4766bf00ed4cd883179041546ac2ab7b7826275e9ad5bdc8dcbffd", "ja": "えっ！？　いや、今のはほんの冗談というか……。", "zh": "诶！？不，刚才那只是开个玩笑……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "e8798ef46cb979164850b76424c9fc990bbcdba51501861bedf6e6e14cd149b9", "ja": "だって、効率が上がるんですよね？\nなら、いいこと尽くめじゃないですか！", "zh": "因为这样效率会提高，对吧？\n那不是好处多多吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "4c3a2f96350997e402bfb2a6f004842a5c80d5f139b719c8e6029e7e6886102f", "ja": "私は本番に向けて、良い練習ができる。\n{$P$}はお仕事が進む。……ね♪", "zh": "我能为正式演出进行充分的练习，{$P$}也能推进工作……对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1016_p", "source_sha256": "efbb90488c1cfe54474c04173afbe45caed0576ca85f984a32632bdeebf32273", "ja": "ね♪って言われても……。", "zh": "就算你这么说“呢♪”……哥哥，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "315d3cd4b7d47f739474194f71393875154127afa9d1eaa8e5a78b193a96febb", "ja": "そういえば、机の上に書類が溜まってましたね。\nあれの提出締切……いつでしたっけ～？", "zh": "说起来，桌上堆了不少文件呢。\n那些文件的提交截止日期……是到什么时候来着～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1018_p", "source_sha256": "69e0f895640f362471381bf3ecaf5385a48f46a3ebeea4deca8e180426984d5d", "ja": "うっ……今日中だな。定時内はやることがいっぱいで。\nそれが終わり次第……。", "zh": "呃……得在今天之内交吧。下班前要做的事太多了。等那些做完之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "f6ddcc1f4bfdb3ca8c61f49f8012dd206371325125f67fe501cb6dc3211efe79", "ja": "はい、決まりですね！　安心してください。\n終わるまで、隣でじっくり見ててあげますから！", "zh": "好，就这么定了！放心吧。在你做完之前，我会一直陪在旁边看着你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b080897dbc5591f97dce96ae414a7a4789bee941a903aa0c9d1f779176892812", "ja": "そ、そこまでしてくれなくても大丈夫だ！\n一人でもできるし、律子もスケジュールが……。", "zh": "不、不用做到这个地步也没关系！\n我一个人也能行，而且律子的日程也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0574_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "d08b878efc5e24a537ccd603c8e905f6f2e3a322aa3dd827cb741ff180b068da", "ja": "私は問題ありません。{$P$}の\n面倒をみる時間くらいはあります。", "zh": "我没问题。抽出点时间照顾{$P$}还是有的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
